#: ../../skills.rst:2
msgid "研究技能"
msgstr "Research Skills"

#: ../../skills.rst:4
msgid ""
"研究技能帮助工作台中的研究助手推进文献检索、假设管理、实验设计、执行和分析。它们通过工作区文件衔接各阶段，便于研究者检查依据、修改配置并复用结果。"
msgstr ""
"Research skills help the workbench assistant search literature, manage "
"hypotheses, design experiments, execute runs and analyze results. They "
"connect stages through workspace files so researchers can inspect evidence, "
"revise configuration and reuse results."

#: ../../skills.rst:6
msgid ""
"研究助手技能由扩展同步到工作区，供 Claude Code / Codex 使用；仿真参与者的行为技能则由 :doc:`/agent_skills` "
"中的运行时管理。首次研究的完整路径见 :doc:`/research_workflow`，输入数据准备见 :doc:`/datasets`。"
msgstr ""
"The extension synchronizes research assistant skills into the workspace for "
"Claude Code / Codex. Simulation participant behavior skills are managed by "
"the runtime described in :doc:`/agent_skills`. For the complete research "
"path, see :doc:`/research_workflow`; for input data, see :doc:`/datasets`."

#: ../../skills.rst:12 ../../skills/workspace.rst:2
msgid "安装与使用研究助手技能"
msgstr "Installing and using research assistant skills"

#: ../../skills.rst:17
msgid "同步研究助手技能，初始化工作区，并按需生成自定义模块。"
msgstr ""
"Synchronize research assistant skills, initialize the workspace and generate"
" custom modules when needed."

#: ../../skills.rst:19 ../../skills/literature.rst:2
msgid "文献检索与假设"
msgstr "Literature search and hypotheses"

#: ../../skills.rst:24
msgid "配置检索服务，保存文献依据，并组织可检验的假设。"
msgstr ""
"Configure search services, save supporting literature and organize testable "
"hypotheses."

#: ../../skills.rst:26 ../../skills/experiments-analysis.rst:2
msgid "实验执行与分析"
msgstr "Experiment execution and analysis"

#: ../../skills.rst:31
msgid "准备配置、执行与监控实验，读取结果并生成分析报告。"
msgstr ""
"Prepare configuration, execute and monitor experiments, read results and "
"generate analysis reports."

#: ../../skills/experiments-analysis.rst:7
msgid "实验工作流"
msgstr "Experiment workflow"

#: ../../skills/experiments-analysis.rst:9
msgid "研究 pipeline 的主干是："
msgstr "The backbone of the research pipeline is:"

#: ../../skills/experiments-analysis.rst:11
msgid ""
"``literature-search → hypothesis → experiment-config → run-experiment → "
"analysis → paper-toolkit``"
msgstr ""
"``literature-search → hypothesis → experiment-config → run-experiment → "
"analysis → paper-toolkit``"

#: ../../skills/experiments-analysis.rst:13
msgid "实验相关的两个核心 skill 是："
msgstr "The two core skills related to experiments are:"

#: ../../skills/experiments-analysis.rst:19
msgid "Skill"
msgstr "Skill"

#: ../../skills/experiments-analysis.rst:20
msgid "主要输入"
msgstr "Main input"

#: ../../skills/experiments-analysis.rst:21
msgid "主要输出"
msgstr "Main output"

#: ../../skills/experiments-analysis.rst:22
msgid "``agentsociety-experiment-config``"
msgstr "``agentsociety-experiment-config``"

#: ../../skills/experiments-analysis.rst:23
msgid "``SIM_SETTINGS.json``、已有 Agent/Env/Dataset 信息"
msgstr "``SIM_SETTINGS.json``, existing Agent/Env/Dataset information"

#: ../../skills/experiments-analysis.rst:24
msgid "``init_config.json``、``steps.yaml``、``config_params.py``"
msgstr "``init_config.json``、``steps.yaml``、``config_params.py``"

#: ../../skills/experiments-analysis.rst:25
msgid "``agentsociety-run-experiment``"
msgstr "``agentsociety-run-experiment``"

#: ../../skills/experiments-analysis.rst:26
msgid "``init_config.json`` + ``steps.yaml``"
msgstr "``init_config.json`` + ``steps.yaml``"

#: ../../skills/experiments-analysis.rst:27
msgid "``run/replay/``、日志、artifacts、``pid.json``"
msgstr "``run/replay/``, logs, artifacts, and ``pid.json``"

#: ../../skills/experiments-analysis.rst:29
#: ../../skills/experiments-analysis.rst:46
msgid "推荐流程："
msgstr "Recommended process:"

#: ../../skills/experiments-analysis.rst:31
msgid "先确认工作区中已经具备 ``init_config.json``、``steps.yaml`` 与所需模块信息。"
msgstr ""
"First confirm that the workspace already contains ``init_config.json``, "
"``steps.yaml``, and the required module information."

#: ../../skills/experiments-analysis.rst:32
msgid "在 ``experiment-config`` 阶段先扫描模块；如果缺少 Agent 或 Env，先补充对应自定义模块，再重新扫描。"
msgstr ""
"During the ``experiment-config`` stage, scan modules first. If an Agent or "
"environment module is missing, add the corresponding custom module and then "
"scan again."

#: ../../skills/experiments-analysis.rst:33
msgid "运行 ``experiment-config check`` 或等价校验，确认配置和步骤文件可用。"
msgstr ""
"Run ``experiment-config check`` or equivalent verification to confirm that "
"the configuration and step files are available."

#: ../../skills/experiments-analysis.rst:34
msgid "启动实验时使用 ``run-experiment``；后台执行必须指定日志文件，避免丢失 verbose 输出。"
msgstr ""
"Use ``run-experiment`` when starting the experiment; a log file must be "
"specified for background execution to avoid losing verbose output."

#: ../../skills/experiments-analysis.rst:35
msgid "实验完成后检查 ``run/replay/_schema.json``、日志与 artifacts，再进入分析阶段。"
msgstr ""
"After the experiment is completed, check ``run/replay/_schema.json``, logs, "
"and artifacts before entering the analysis phase."

#: ../../skills/experiments-analysis.rst:41
msgid "分析工作流"
msgstr "Analysis workflow"

#: ../../skills/experiments-analysis.rst:43
msgid ""
"``agentsociety-analysis`` 面向已完成实验的数据解释、图表和报告生成。当前 replay 数据位于 "
"``run/replay/``，可通过 ``ReplayReader`` / DuckDB 读取；如果 ``_schema.json`` 不存在，应回到"
" ``run-experiment`` 或配置修复阶段。"
msgstr ""
"``agentsociety-analysis`` handles data interpretation, charts, and report "
"generation for completed experiments. Replay data lives in ``run/replay/`` "
"and can be read through ``ReplayReader`` / DuckDB. If ``_schema.json`` does "
"not exist, return to ``run-experiment`` or the configuration repair phase."

#: ../../skills/experiments-analysis.rst:48
msgid "**加载上下文**：读取 hypothesis、experiment config、steps 和 run 元数据。"
msgstr ""
"**Load context**: Read hypothesis, experiment config, steps, and run "
"metadata."

#: ../../skills/experiments-analysis.rst:49
msgid "**确认问题**：明确本次分析是验证假设、解释异常、比较组间差异，还是生成报告。"
msgstr ""
"**Clarify the question**: Clarify whether this analysis is to test "
"hypotheses, explain anomalies, compare differences between groups, or "
"generate a report."

#: ../../skills/experiments-analysis.rst:50
msgid "**探索数据**：列出 replay dataset，查看 schema、行数、关键字段和缺失情况。"
msgstr ""
"**Explore data**: List replay datasets and view the schema, number of rows, "
"key fields, and missing values."

#: ../../skills/experiments-analysis.rst:51
msgid "**提出发现**：先给出可检验发现，再决定需要哪些图表。"
msgstr ""
"**Propose findings**: Present testable findings first, then decide which "
"charts are needed."

#: ../../skills/experiments-analysis.rst:52
msgid "**生成图表**：单实验默认最多 5 张图；每张图在报告中必须有一句说明。"
msgstr ""
"**Generate charts**: A single experiment can have up to 5 charts by default;"
" each chart must have a corresponding explanation in the report."

#: ../../skills/experiments-analysis.rst:53
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**写报告**：单实验输出到 ``presentation/hypothesis_{id}/``，跨实验综合输出到 ``synthesis/``。"
msgstr ""
"**Write report**: Single-experiment output goes to "
"``presentation/hypothesis_{id}/``, and cross-experiment synthesis output "
"goes to ``synthesis/``."

#: ../../skills/experiments-analysis.rst:55
msgid ""
"报告与状态目录约定：用户可见报告写在 ``presentation/`` 与 ``synthesis/``；harness 机器状态在 "
"``.agentsociety/analysis/``；不要在 ``presentation/`` 下再建旧式 ``analysis/`` 目录。"
msgstr ""
"Report and state paths: user-facing reports go under ``presentation/`` and "
"``synthesis/``; harness machine state lives under "
"``.agentsociety/analysis/``; do not recreate a legacy ``analysis/`` tree "
"under ``presentation/``."

#: ../../skills/experiments-analysis.rst:57
msgid "常用命令："
msgstr "Commonly used commands:"

#: ../../skills/experiments-analysis.rst:59
msgid ""
"python .agentsociety/bin/ags.py analysis load-context --workspace . --hypothesis-id 1 --experiment-id 1\n"
"python - <<'PY'\n"
"from agentsociety2.storage import ReplayReader\n"
"reader = ReplayReader(\"hypothesis_1/experiment_1/run/replay\")\n"
"for dataset in reader.load_dataset_catalog():\n"
"    print(dataset[\"dataset_id\"], dataset[\"table_name\"])\n"
"reader.close()\n"
"PY"
msgstr ""
"python .agentsociety/bin/ags.py analysis load-context --workspace . --hypothesis-id 1 --experiment-id 1\n"
"python - <<'PY'\n"
"from agentsociety2.storage import ReplayReader\n"
"reader = ReplayReader(\"hypothesis_1/experiment_1/run/replay\")\n"
"for dataset in reader.load_dataset_catalog():\n"
"    print(dataset[\"dataset_id\"], dataset[\"table_name\"])\n"
"reader.close()\n"
"PY"

#: ../../skills/experiments-analysis.rst:73
msgid "实验技能 (experiment)"
msgstr "Experiment Skill"

#: ../../skills/experiments-analysis.rst:75
#: ../../skills/experiments-analysis.rst:81
msgid "实验设计、配置与执行：工作区文件到运行产物"
msgstr ""
"Experiment Design, Configuration and Execution: Files to Run Artifacts"

#: ../../skills/experiments-analysis.rst:83
msgid ""
"左侧是研究设计，中间是可执行配置，右侧是运行产物。新实验的时序数据写入 JSONL replay，恢复状态写入 "
"checkpoint；二者用途不同，具体布局见 :doc:`/storage`。"
msgstr ""
"The left column is research design, the middle is executable configuration, "
"and the right is run output. New experiments write time-series data to JSONL"
" replay and recovery state to checkpoints; see :doc:`/storage` for layouts."

#: ../../skills/experiments-analysis.rst:107
msgid "分析技能 (analysis)"
msgstr "Analysis Skill"

#: ../../skills/experiments-analysis.rst:109
#: ../../skills/experiments-analysis.rst:115
msgid "分析工作流：数据核验、发现、资源与报告"
msgstr "Analysis Workflow: Data Checks, Findings, Assets and Reports"

#: ../../skills/experiments-analysis.rst:117
msgid ""
"从 replay 读取数据并生成图表，报告写入 ``presentation/``，跨实验综合写入 ``synthesis/``；harness "
"状态保存在 ``.agentsociety/analysis/``。"
msgstr ""
"Read replay data and create charts. Reports go to ``presentation/``, cross-"
"experiment synthesis to ``synthesis/``, and harness state to "
"``.agentsociety/analysis/``."

#: ../../skills/experiments-analysis.rst:119
msgid ""
"from pathlib import Path\n"
"\n"
"from agentsociety2.storage import ReplayReader\n"
"from agentsociety2.skills.analysis import ContextLoader\n"
"\n"
"workspace = Path(\"./workspace\")\n"
"context = ContextLoader(workspace).load_context(\"1\", \"1\")\n"
"reader = ReplayReader(workspace / \"hypothesis_1\" / \"experiment_1\" / \"run\" / \"replay\")\n"
"datasets = reader.load_dataset_catalog()\n"
"rows = reader.fetch_dataset_rows(\n"
"    reader.get_dataset_by_id(\"core.agent_profile\"),\n"
"    limit=5,\n"
")\n"
"reader.close()"
msgstr ""
"from pathlib import Path\n"
"from agentsociety2.skills.hypothesis import add_hypothesis, get_hypothesis, list_hypotheses\n"
"\n"
"# Add a hypothesis\n"
"add_hypothesis(\n"
"    workspace_path=Path(\"./workspace\"),\n"
"    hypothesis_data={\n"
"        \"hypothesis\": {\n"
"            \"description\": \"Higher network density leads to faster information propagation\",\n"
"            \"rationale\": \"Higher density provides more propagation paths\",\n"
"        },\n"
"        \"groups\": [\n"
"            {\n"
"                \"name\": \"high_density\",\n"
"                \"group_type\": \"treatment\",\n"
"                \"description\": \"High-density network\",\n"
"            }\n"
"        ],\n"
"    },\n"
")\n"
"\n"
"# List hypotheses\n"
"hypotheses = list_hypotheses(workspace_path=Path(\"./workspace\"))"

#: ../../skills/experiments-analysis.rst:136
msgid ""
"跨实验对比不再使用独立综合 skill，而是作为 ``agentsociety-analysis`` 的 Stage 6 在 Claude Code "
"中完成。"
msgstr ""
"The cross-experiment comparison no longer uses a separate synthesis skill; "
"it is completed in Claude Code as Stage 6 of ``agentsociety-analysis``."

#: ../../skills/experiments-analysis.rst:142
msgid "论文写作"
msgstr "Paper Writing"

#: ../../skills/experiments-analysis.rst:144
msgid ""
"完成分析报告、核对图表与证据后，可通过 ``paper-toolkit`` "
"继续论文写作。研究技能负责文献、假设、实验与分析，各阶段的产物可供写作流程继续使用。"
msgstr ""
"After completing the analysis report and checking figures and evidence, "
"continue manuscript writing with ``paper-toolkit``. Research skills handle "
"literature, hypotheses, experiments, and analysis; artifacts from each stage"
" can be reused in the writing workflow."

#: ../../skills/experiments-analysis.rst:149
msgid "完整工作流示例"
msgstr "Complete Workflow Example"

#: ../../skills/experiments-analysis.rst:151
msgid "下面是一个使用 Claude Code Skills 的典型研究工作流："
msgstr "Here's a typical research workflow using Claude Code Skills:"

#: ../../skills/experiments-analysis.rst:153
msgid "**定义研究话题** - 编辑 ``TOPIC.md``"
msgstr "**Define research topic** - Edit ``TOPIC.md``"

#: ../../skills/experiments-analysis.rst:154
msgid "**文献检索** - 使用 ``/agentsociety-literature-search``"
msgstr "**Literature search** - Use ``/agentsociety-literature-search``"

#: ../../skills/experiments-analysis.rst:155
msgid "**创建假设** - 使用 ``/agentsociety-hypothesis add``"
msgstr "**Create hypothesis** - Use ``/agentsociety-hypothesis add``"

#: ../../skills/experiments-analysis.rst:156
msgid "**配置实验** - 使用 ``/agentsociety-experiment-config validate/prepare/run``"
msgstr ""
"**Configure experiment** - Use ``/agentsociety-experiment-config "
"validate/prepare/run``"

#: ../../skills/experiments-analysis.rst:157
msgid "**执行实验** - 使用 ``/agentsociety-run-experiment start``"
msgstr "**Run experiment** - Use ``/agentsociety-run-experiment start``"

#: ../../skills/experiments-analysis.rst:158
msgid "**分析结果** - 使用 ``/agentsociety-analysis``"
msgstr "**Analyze results** - Use ``/agentsociety-analysis``"

#: ../../skills/experiments-analysis.rst:159
msgid "**生成论文** - 使用独立 ``paper-toolkit`` 工作流"
msgstr "**Generate paper** - Use the standalone ``paper-toolkit`` workflow"

#: ../../skills/experiments-analysis.rst:164
msgid "配置"
msgstr "Configuration"

#: ../../skills/experiments-analysis.rst:166
msgid "研究技能使用相同的 LLM 配置。可以通过环境变量为特定技能配置不同的模型："
msgstr ""
"Research skills use the same LLM configuration. Different models can be "
"configured for specific skills via environment variables:"

#: ../../skills/experiments-analysis.rst:168
msgid ""
"# 默认 LLM\n"
"export AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_MODEL=\"gpt-5.5\"\n"
"\n"
"# 代码生成（实验设计、分析）\n"
"export AGENTSOCIETY_CODER_LLM_MODEL=\"gpt-5.5\""
msgstr ""
"# Default LLM\n"
"export AGENTSOCIETY_LLM_MODEL=\"gpt-5.5\"\n"
"\n"
"# Code generation for experiment design and analysis\n"
"export AGENTSOCIETY_CODER_LLM_MODEL=\"gpt-5.5\""

#: ../../skills/literature.rst:7
msgid "学术文献检索"
msgstr "Literature search service"

#: ../../skills/literature.rst:9
msgid ""
"``agentsociety-literature-search`` 通过统一的远程检索服务收集学术文献，并把结果保存到工作区 ``papers/`` "
"目录。默认检索所有已配置数据源：``local``、``arxiv``、``crossref``、``openalex``。"
msgstr ""
"``agentsociety-literature-search`` Collect academic literature through a "
"unified remote search service and save the results to the workspace "
"``papers/`` directory. All configured data sources are retrieved by default:"
" ``local``, ``arxiv``, ``crossref``, ``openalex``."

#: ../../skills/literature.rst:11
msgid "配置项："
msgstr "Configuration:"

#: ../../skills/literature.rst:13 ../../skills/literature.rst:115
msgid ""
"LITERATURE_SEARCH_MCP_URL=https://llmapi.fiblab.net/mcp/\n"
"LITERATURE_SEARCH_API_KEY=your-literature-search-key"
msgstr ""
"LITERATURE_SEARCH_MCP_URL=https://llmapi.fiblab.net/mcp/\n"
"LITERATURE_SEARCH_API_KEY=your-literature-search-key"

#: ../../skills/literature.rst:18
msgid "搜索命令示例："
msgstr "Search command example:"

#: ../../skills/literature.rst:20
msgid ""
"python .agentsociety/bin/ags.py literature-search \"agent-based modeling social networks\"\n"
"python .agentsociety/bin/ags.py literature-search \"urban mobility simulation LLM agents\" --year-from 2020 --year-to 2026 --multi-query"
msgstr ""
"python .agentsociety/bin/ags.py literature-search \"agent-based modeling social networks\"\n"
"python .agentsociety/bin/ags.py literature-search \"urban mobility simulation LLM agents\" --year-from 2020 --year-to 2026 --multi-query"

#: ../../skills/literature.rst:25
msgid "输出约定："
msgstr "Output convention:"

#: ../../skills/literature.rst:27
msgid ""
"``papers/literature_index.json`` 是稳定索引，记录标题、作者、年份、来源、query、分数和本地 "
"``file_path``。"
msgstr ""
"``papers/literature_index.json`` is a stable index, recording title, author,"
" year, source, query, score and local ``file_path``."

#: ../../skills/literature.rst:28
msgid ""
"每篇文献保存为 ``papers/<title>_<timestamp>.md``，这是后续 hypothesis、analysis 与外部 "
"``paper-toolkit`` 写作流程引用的主要本地笔记。"
msgstr ""
"Each document is saved as ``papers/<title>_<timestamp>.md``, which is the "
"main local note cited by subsequent hypothesis, analysis, and the external "
"``paper-toolkit`` writing workflow."

#: ../../skills/literature.rst:29
msgid ""
"检索完成后会自动尝试下载开放获取 PDF 到 ``papers/full_texts/``，路径写入 "
"``extra_fields.full_text.file_path``；不要把索引中的 ``file_path`` 从 Markdown 笔记替换成 "
"PDF。"
msgstr ""
"If the original PDF is to be downloaded, it should be placed in "
"``papers/full_texts/`` and recorded in ``extra_fields.full_text.file_path``;"
" do not replace ``file_path`` in the index from Markdown notes to PDF."

#: ../../skills/literature.rst:30
msgid ""
"文献检索不会自动绕过出版商权限。PDF 下载只处理开放获取或用户授权的文件；没有开放 PDF 时，可以补充本地 Markdown 笔记并记录来源。"
msgstr ""
"Literature search does not bypass publisher access controls. PDF downloads "
"only process open-access or user-authorized files. If no open PDF is "
"available, local Markdown notes may be added together with the recorded "
"source."

#: ../../skills/literature.rst:35
msgid "文献技能 (literature)"
msgstr "Literature Skill"

#: ../../skills/literature.rst:37
msgid ""
"文献技能通过 **MCP 协议** 连接学术文献检索网关，使用工作区 ``.env`` 中的 ``LITERATURE_SEARCH_MCP_URL``"
" 和 ``LITERATURE_SEARCH_API_KEY``（无需单独配置 Claude ``mcp.json``）。网关上的其他 MCP "
"工具不会被文献技能调用。推荐优先使用 ``search_literature_and_save``，而不是直接调用底层 "
"``search_literature``：前者会把检索结果落到工作区中，确保后续 Agent、Claude Code "
"和论文写作技能都能通过本地文件继续引用这些文献。"
msgstr ""
"The literature skill connects to the academic literature search gateway "
"through the **MCP protocol**, using ``LITERATURE_SEARCH_MCP_URL`` and "
"``LITERATURE_SEARCH_API_KEY`` from the workspace ``.env`` (no separate "
"Claude ``mcp.json`` configuration needed). Other MCP tools on the gateway "
"are not called by the literature skill. It is recommended to use "
"``search_literature_and_save`` instead of calling the underlying "
"``search_literature`` directly: the former will drop the search results into"
" the workspace, ensuring that subsequent Agents, Claude Code and paper "
"writing skills can continue to reference these documents through local "
"files."

#: ../../skills/literature.rst:42
msgid ""
"from pathlib import Path\n"
"from agentsociety2.skills.literature import search_literature_and_save, load_literature_index\n"
"\n"
"# 搜索并保存文献（默认 10 篇、已配置数据源，并更新 papers/literature_index.json）\n"
"result = await search_literature_and_save(\n"
"    workspace_path=Path(\"./workspace\"),\n"
"    query=\"agent-based modeling social networks\",\n"
"    year_from=2020,      # 可选：年份筛选\n"
"    year_to=2024,\n"
"    enable_multi_query=True,  # 可选：启用多查询模式\n"
")\n"
"\n"
"# 指定数据源搜索\n"
"await search_literature_and_save(\n"
"    workspace_path=Path(\"./workspace\"),\n"
"    query=\"machine learning\",\n"
"    sources=[\"local\", \"arxiv\"],  # 可选：指定数据源\n"
")\n"
"\n"
"# 加载文献索引\n"
"index = load_literature_index(workspace_path=Path(\"./workspace\"))"
msgstr ""
"from pathlib import Path\n"
"from agentsociety2.skills.hypothesis import add_hypothesis, get_hypothesis, list_hypotheses\n"
"\n"
"# Add a hypothesis\n"
"add_hypothesis(\n"
"    workspace_path=Path(\"./workspace\"),\n"
"    hypothesis_data={\n"
"        \"hypothesis\": {\n"
"            \"description\": \"Higher network density leads to faster information propagation\",\n"
"            \"rationale\": \"Higher density provides more propagation paths\",\n"
"        },\n"
"        \"groups\": [\n"
"            {\n"
"                \"name\": \"high_density\",\n"
"                \"group_type\": \"treatment\",\n"
"                \"description\": \"High-density network\",\n"
"            }\n"
"        ],\n"
"    },\n"
")\n"
"\n"
"# List hypotheses\n"
"hypotheses = list_hypotheses(workspace_path=Path(\"./workspace\"))"

#: ../../skills/literature.rst:66
msgid "**保存结果**:"
msgstr "**Save results**:"

#: ../../skills/literature.rst:68
msgid ""
"每篇检索结果都会保存为 ``papers/<title>_<timestamp>.md``。这个 Markdown "
"文件是稳定的本地文献笔记，包含标题、检索词、年份、期刊、 DOI/URL、摘要、作者和相关内容片段。"
msgstr ""
"Each search result will be saved as ``papers/<title>_<timestamp>.md``. This "
"Markdown file is a stable local literature note that contains title, search "
"terms, year, journal, DOI/URL, abstract, author, and related content "
"fragments."

#: ../../skills/literature.rst:70
msgid ""
"``papers/literature_index.json`` 会同步更新。索引中的 ``file_path`` 指向本地 Markdown "
"文献笔记，因此插件中的 ``@引用`` 可以复制为 ``@papers/<title>_<timestamp>.md``，供 Claude Code 或"
" Agent 读取。"
msgstr ""
"``papers/literature_index.json`` will be updated simultaneously. "
"``file_path`` in the index points to the local Markdown literature note, so "
"the ``@cite`` button in the plug-in can be copied as "
"``@papers/<title>_<timestamp>.md`` for Claude Code or Agent to read."

#: ../../skills/literature.rst:73
msgid "重复运行检索时会生成新的本地文献笔记，并追加到索引中，便于保留不同检索轮次的上下文。"
msgstr ""
"When a search is run repeatedly, new local literature notes are generated "
"and appended to the index, allowing context to be retained across different "
"search rounds."

#: ../../skills/literature.rst:75
msgid "**原文下载（由 Claude/Agent 按需执行）**:"
msgstr "**Full-text download (on demand by Claude/Agent)**:"

#: ../../skills/literature.rst:77
msgid ""
"``search_literature_and_save`` 默认会尝试下载开放获取的原文，可用 "
"``download_full_text=False`` 关闭；下载失败不会把元数据笔记替换成错误文件。检索结果会尽量保留 "
"``doi``、``url``、``pdf_url``、``full_text_url``、``download_url``、 "
"``open_access``、``best_oa_location`` 等元信息；Claude Code 或 Agent "
"可以基于这些线索按需下载开放获取原文。"
msgstr ""
"``search_literature_and_save`` attempts open-access downloads by default; "
"set ``download_full_text=False`` to disable them. Failed downloads do not "
"replace metadata notes with error files. Results retain metadata such as "
"``doi``, ``url``, ``pdf_url``, ``full_text_url``, ``download_url``, "
"``open_access`` and ``best_oa_location``; Claude Code or an agent can use "
"these to obtain open-access full text as needed."

#: ../../skills/literature.rst:82
msgid "建议的下载约定："
msgstr "Recommended download conventions:"

#: ../../skills/literature.rst:84
msgid "原文 PDF 放在 ``papers/full_texts/*.pdf``。"
msgstr "The original PDF is located at ``papers/full_texts/*.pdf``."

#: ../../skills/literature.rst:85
msgid ""
"优先使用 API 返回的 PDF 直链；arXiv 论文可从 ``/abs/<id>`` 转为 "
"``https://arxiv.org/pdf/<id>.pdf``。"
msgstr ""
"Priority is given to PDF direct links returned by the API; arXiv papers can "
"be converted from ``/abs/<id>`` to ``https://arxiv.org/pdf/<id>.pdf``."

#: ../../skills/literature.rst:87
msgid "DOI 仅作为落地页线索，不保证能直接得到 PDF；如果需要下载，应确认最终响应确实是 PDF。"
msgstr ""
"The DOI is only used as a landing page clue, and there is no guarantee that "
"the PDF will be obtained directly; if you need to download it, you should "
"confirm that the final response is indeed a PDF."

#: ../../skills/literature.rst:88
msgid "下载完成后，可在对应索引条目的 ``extra_fields[\"full_text\"]`` 中记录:"
msgstr ""
"After the download is completed, it can be recorded in "
"``extra_fields[\"full_text\"]`` of the corresponding index entry:"

#: ../../skills/literature.rst:90
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"status\": \"downloaded\",\n"
"  \"file_path\": \"papers/full_texts/example.pdf\",\n"
"  \"source_url\": \"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2401.01234.pdf\"\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"{\n"
"  \"status\": \"downloaded\",\n"
"  \"file_path\": \"papers/full_texts/example.pdf\",\n"
"  \"source_url\": \"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2401.01234.pdf\"\n"
"}"

#: ../../skills/literature.rst:98
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"如果没有找到开放原文，也可以记录 ``{\"status\": \"no_candidate\"}`` 或 ``{\"status\": "
"\"failed\", \"reason\": \"...\"}``，便于插件页面显示状态。"
msgstr ""
"If the open original text is not found, you can also record ``{\"status\": "
"\"no_candidate\"}`` or ``{\"status\": \"failed\", \"reason\": \"...\"}`` to "
"facilitate the plug-in page to display the status."

#: ../../skills/literature.rst:103
msgid ""
"许多 CrossRef/OpenAlex 结果只提供 DOI 或落地页，不一定有开放 PDF。 Claude/Agent 不应绕过出版商权限，也不应把 "
"HTML 落地页当作 PDF 保存。"
msgstr ""
"Many CrossRef/OpenAlex results only offer a DOI or landing page, not "
"necessarily an open PDF. Claude/Agent should not bypass publisher "
"permissions or save HTML landing pages as PDFs."

#: ../../skills/literature.rst:106
msgid ""
"**数据源**: - ``local``: RAGFlow 本地知识库 - ``arxiv``: arXiv 预印本平台 - ``crossref``:"
" CrossRef DOI 元数据库 - ``openalex``: OpenAlex 学术图谱"
msgstr ""
"**Data sources**: - ``local``: RAGFlow knowledge base - ``arxiv``: arXiv "
"preprints - ``crossref``: CrossRef DOI metadata - ``openalex``: OpenAlex "
"scholarly graph"

#: ../../skills/literature.rst:112
msgid ""
"**配置**: 在 workspace ``.env`` 中配置 MCP（无需 Claude ``mcp.json``，除非要让 Claude "
"独立连接同一网关）:"
msgstr ""
"**Configuration**: configure MCP in workspace ``.env``. Claude ``mcp.json`` "
"is not needed unless Claude should independently connect to the same "
"gateway:"

