"``.agentsociety/``，请先执行："
msgstr ""
"The ``.agentsociety/bin/ags.py`` commands on this page require an "
"**initialized workspace**. Sync the corresponding research skills to "
"``.claude/skills/`` and use a Python environment containing the SDK. If the "
"current directory does not yet contain ``.agentsociety/``, run:"

#: ../../skills/workspace.rst:40
