"agentsociety-workspace init --target-dir .\n"
"python .agentsociety/bin/ags.py create-agent --file custom/agents/my_agent.py\n"
"python .agentsociety/bin/ags.py create-agent --file custom/agents/my_agent.py --json"
msgstr ""
"agentsociety-workspace init --target-dir .\n"
"python .agentsociety/bin/ags.py create-agent --file custom/agents/my_agent.py\n"
"python .agentsociety/bin/ags.py create-agent --file custom/agents/my_agent.py --json"

#: ../../skills/workspace.rst:80
msgid ""
"以下命令使用已安装 ``agentsociety2`` 的 Python 环境；若工作区配置了独立解释器，请用该解释器替换 ``python``。"
msgstr ""
"Use a Python environment with ``agentsociety2`` installed. Replace "
"``python`` with the workspace interpreter when using a separate environment."

#: ../../skills/workspace.rst:82
msgid ""
"校验器会检查：目标文件为 Python 文件、至少有一个直接继承 ``AgentBase`` 或 ``PersonAgent`` 的类、``ask`` "
"/ ``step`` / ``to_workspace`` 均为 ``async def``（同时保持继承的 ``create`` / "
"``from_workspace`` 工作区契约可用）、模块可动态导入、目标类不是 abstract class。创建完成后，在 VS Code "
"扩展中执行 **Scan Custom Modules** 让后端重新发现模块。"
msgstr ""
"The validator checks that the target is a Python file containing at least "
"one direct ``AgentBase`` or ``PersonAgent`` subclass, that ``ask`` / "
"``step`` / ``to_workspace`` are ``async def`` methods, that the inherited "
"``create`` / ``from_workspace`` workspace contract remains usable, that the "
"module imports dynamically, and that the class is concrete. Then run **Scan "
"Custom Modules** in the VS Code extension to rediscover the module."

#: ../../skills/workspace.rst:85
msgid "按任务选择辅助技能"
msgstr "Choosing supporting skills by task"

#: ../../skills/workspace.rst:87
msgid ""
"不知道可用的类名或参数时，先用 ``agentsociety-scan-modules``；已有合适模块时直接配置实验。只有模块能力不足，才进入 "
"``agentsociety-create-agent`` 或 ``agentsociety-create-env-"
"module``，生成后再扫描与验证。"
msgstr ""
"Use ``agentsociety-scan-modules`` first when class names or parameters are "
"unknown. If a suitable module exists, configure the experiment directly. Use"
" ``agentsociety-create-agent`` or ``agentsociety-create-env-module`` only "
"when more capability is needed, then scan and validate the generated module."

#: ../../skills/workspace.rst:89
msgid ""
"已有稿件时，可用 ``agentsociety-paper-review`` "
"检查论点、证据与呈现方式，输出内部模拟评审和建议。它不会自动改稿、重跑实验或更新研究进度；研究者确认后，再由相应研究技能处理需要回访的阶段。写作与排版继续通过独立的"
" ``paper-toolkit`` 完成。"
msgstr ""
"For an existing manuscript, ``agentsociety-paper-review`` checks arguments, "
"evidence and presentation, producing an internal mock review and "
"recommendations. It does not revise the manuscript, rerun experiments or "
"update research progress automatically. After researcher approval, the "
"relevant research skill handles any earlier stage that needs revisiting. "
"Writing and typesetting continue through the separate ``paper-toolkit``."

#: ../../skills/experiments-analysis.rst:85
msgid ""
"from pathlib import Path\n"
"from agentsociety2.skills.experiment import (\n"
"    start_experiment, get_experiment_status,\n"
"    get_available_env_modules, get_available_agent_modules\n"
")\n"
"\n"
"# 获取可用模块\n"
"env_modules = get_available_env_modules()\n"
"agent_modules = get_available_agent_modules()\n"
"\n"
"# 校验启动输入并返回配置文件和运行路径\n"
"run_inputs = await start_experiment(\n"
"    workspace_path=Path(\"./workspace\"),\n"
"    hypothesis_id=\"1\",\n"
"    experiment_id=\"1\"\n"
")"
msgstr ""
"from pathlib import Path\n"
"from agentsociety2.skills.experiment import (\n"
"    start_experiment, get_experiment_status,\n"
"    get_available_env_modules, get_available_agent_modules\n"
")\n"
"\n"
"# Get available modules\n"
"env_modules = get_available_env_modules()\n"
"agent_modules = get_available_agent_modules()\n"
"\n"
"# Validate launch inputs and obtain the configuration and run paths\n"
"run_inputs = await start_experiment(\n"
"    workspace_path=Path(\"./workspace\"),\n"
"    hypothesis_id=\"1\",\n"
"    experiment_id=\"1\"\n"
")"

#: ../../skills/workspace.rst:44
msgid ""
"等价入口是 ``python -m agentsociety2.society.workspace init --target-dir .``。 地图 "
"``.agentsociety/data/beijing_map.pb`` 是可选资产：离线或不需要地图时加 ``--skip-"
"map``；已存在的地图会被复用，下载失败只记录为 skipped，不会让初始化失败。"
msgstr ""
"The equivalent entry point is ``python -m agentsociety2.society.workspace "
"init --target-dir .``. The map at ``.agentsociety/data/beijing_map.pb`` is "
"optional. Use ``--skip-map`` offline or when no map is needed. "
"Initialization reuses an existing map and records a failed download as "
"skipped."
